- dp1[i]: max subarray sum up to i where we have applied multiply operation to some subarray that ends at or before i, and the current sum subarray includes the modified part
- dp2[i]: max subarray sum up to i where we have applied divide operation to some subarray that ends at or before i, and the current sum subarray includes the modified part

Transitions:
- dp0[i] = max(nums[i], dp0[i-1] + nums[i])  # no operation used yet
- dp1[i]:
