  - Extend operation from i-1: dp1[i-1] + k*nums[i]  # continue multiply operation, include nums[i] in sum
  - Continue sum without starting new operation: dp0[i-1] + k*nums[i]  # operation already applied, include nums[i] in sum
  - Start sum after operation: k*nums[i] (operation at i, sum starts at i)
- Similarly for dp2[i] with div[i]

